</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord Jesus, free me today</l><l>From world and sin—all vanity—</l><l>To pursue You, Your reality;</l><l>Let me say, “You now live in me”</l><l>And “It’s no longer I who live;”</l><l>But dear Jesus, grace me today.</l><l>Let me live You out, Lord;</l><l>Let me magnify You through me.</l><l>I’ll let You; Lord, be my replacement.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, thank You for Your mercy;</l><l>Your grace, it’s true, sustains me.</l><l>Lord, I realize I’m weak and faint.</l><l>I need You, Jesus; speak today;</l><l>Come and infuse me more each day.</l><l>Lord I realize, I’m full of taint.</l><l>Increase more Your weight, Lord.</l><l>Let Your glory shine upon me.</l><l>I’m open; Lord, make me Your treasure.</l></lg>
<lg><l>Now my daily life, I’ve seen;</l><l>It’s devoid of Your dear life, Lord.</l><l>I need You, Lord. Oh! Jesus, do fill it.</l><l>Yes, fill it—still I’m short of this—</l><l>Until I’m full of life,</l><l>Mature, and one with You eternally.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
